AUTH-001

Missing Rate Limiting on Login

The /login endpoint does not enforce any rate limiting, account lockout mechanism, or delay mechanism between failed attempts.

Proof: Able to send 1,000 requests per minute (RPM) via Burp Intruder without response delay or IP blocking.

Critical

